      "side": 1,
      "message": "In general, this is a really big CL and I would prefer to be able to review chunks of rules that are organized by topic or impacted directory. I think it would also be good to have an understanding of a) the directory and structure that these tools require and b) agree on how that will map to Skia\u0027s own agents/ directory as well as other AI-motivated files that we are working to add.\n\nAdding Greg as he has been organizing how we might otherwise add readmes and agent files throughout our code base, and has been focused on agentic code style enforcement.\n\nLastly, do these need to be so verbose? Where can we find the allowed values for `rubric` and `severity`?",
      "revId": "7c0897198715812de7020a4c0b68634a7d5e0a26",
